    "body": "I really don't think you should say it could be a change type that doesn't belong to any other values. Currently unknown is being used to say it is \"unknown\" if zero or more events have occurred, so that the developer will trigger a poll.\r\n\r\nSending out \"unknown\" for OS events that are specific to some platform would be a confusing signal to developers.",
