    "body": "FWIW this is just an explainer (not a spec) so I don't think it's necessary to enumerate all the possible scenarios the implementation may choose to use this change type. This document already has several hedges about how changes are \"best-effort\" etc., so this seems fine to me ¯\\\\_(ツ)_/¯",
